WEBVTT

00:09:00.101 --> 00:09:01.523
MJ: Jacqueline Culp.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:03.377
Pianist: Trayvon Martin.

00:09:04.021 --> 00:09:05.355
AYGTK: Sandra Bland.

00:09:06.133 --> 00:09:07.831
And too many others.

00:09:08.834 --> 00:09:12.849
The 1901 fair's legacies persist

00:09:12.873 --> 00:09:16.103
in more ways than we can imagine.

00:09:18.315 --> 00:09:19.498
MJ: Mary Talbert

00:09:19.522 --> 00:09:21.623
and the National Association
of Colored Women

00:09:21.647 --> 00:09:24.522
started movements against lynching

00:09:24.546 --> 00:09:26.537
and the myth of black criminality

00:09:26.561 --> 00:09:30.101
just as black women today
started Black Lives Matter.